{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 154150, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 103182, "uid": 92835, "type": 4, "title": "关于初始号", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1649815375, "updated_at": 1680741846, "updated_uid": 92835, "comment_at": 1680741699, "last_at": 1687798151, "comment_count": 15, "status": 1, "summary": "前言本人的入坑之路：日服1自建1初始（300元）=>国际服2个初始（共700元）=>韩服1半成品（720）。交的学费满满。是否需要购买初始号如果你在群或者贴吧问，回答大概率都是不推荐的。原因有2：不会", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/577544.JPG,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/119657.JPG,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_2001/1069/92835/2023/3/6/829421.JPG", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 10, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 70766, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 4, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 154150, "content": "<div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">前言</span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">本人的入坑之路：日服 1自建1初始（300元） =&gt; 国际服 2个初始（共700元） =&gt; 韩服 1半成品（720）。 交的学费满满。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\" style=\"margin:0px1px0.26667rem;width:calc(100%-0.16rem);background:rgb(0,182,79);\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\" style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.37333rem;width:auto;color:rgb(255,255,255);\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\"><span style=\"\">是否需要购买初始号</span></span></div></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">如果你在群或者贴吧问，回答大概率都是不推荐的。原因有2：</span></div><div style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div style=\"\"><ol data-level=\"0\" class=\"ol-list-style\"><li><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">不会玩抽鸡肋池子<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">浪费资源，导致废号</span>，导致浪费钱。（加群问大佬可解决）</span></span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;韩服之前封禁了大量开挂推图的初始号，导致<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">目前市面上大部分的初始号其实也就签到了半年左右</span>，一般以666（3个U五星3个U四星）+ 换策划福利（10w钻+1000血石）为主，资源较少。（性价比低不推荐买高价初始）</span></span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">推荐操作如下：</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><br></span></div><div><ol data-level=\"0\" class=\"ol-list-style\"><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">&nbsp;</span>自建或<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">详细阅读wiki攻略</span>先了解体验游戏，再考虑初始或者半成品。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">买价格不超过100元的初始</span>（贵的初始不如直接半成品），<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">克制住自己抽卡的欲望，先加群问管理号如何规划</span>。</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;买半成品，价格不超过1000元，严格克制自己不然废号退坑浪费钱的概率极大。</span></li></ol><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span></div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div style=\"\"><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">此游戏韩服除了联动（我也没有），其他所有的角色都非常容易获取也很容易全图鉴，所以不要看到一个角色喜欢就用钻石狂抽，完全没有必要，合理利用资源抽正确的池子，比xp抽卡可以<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">更快</span>更多的<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">得到</span>纸片老婆。</span></div></div><div style=\"\"></div></span></span><div style=\"\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">\n\n</div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">加群问大佬很重要</span></div></div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"><div></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div>wiki群：930267486</div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">贴吧群：881522482</span><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\" style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">萌新群：<span style=\"\">703241631</span></span><div></div><div><br></div><div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/577544.JPG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/577544.JPG\" style=\"height: 318px; width: 180px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2001\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/119657.JPG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/119657.JPG\" style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;height:319px;width:180px;\" data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2001\"><img data-width=\"1125\" data-height=\"2001\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_2001/1069/92835/2023/3/6/829421.JPG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_2001/1069/92835/2023/3/6/829421.JPG\" style=\"width: 180px; height: 320px;\"></div></div><div><br></div><div>问问题艾特管理，不行艾特我，注意礼貌用语，我脾气好，但不是所有人脾气都好。</div></span></span><div></div></span><div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/577544.JPG", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/92835/2022/3/13/119657.JPG", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/w_1125/h_2001/1069/92835/2023/3/6/829421.JPG"]